    "title": "Deadline extended for new well registration program in Salinas Valley - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Staff Report ,\n13 hours ago SALINAS VALLEY — Monterey County Water Resources Agency (MCWRA) and the Salinas Valley Basin Groundwater Sustainability Agency (SVBGSA) have extended the deadline of a new well registration program that was established to better understand and protect groundwater resources in the Salinas Valley. All well owners are asked to register... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
